    <div class="h2">Value Build-Out by Scenario</div>
    <div class="body"><p>Holding the as-of-right building program constant (7,473 SF lot &times; 5.04x comp-implied FAR = ~37,660 GSF / ~24 units), the three scenarios below flex the pricing assumption against the 361 Central Ave basis &mdash; from a modest premium reflecting continued corridor appreciation down to a conservative read still at or above the comp's own basis.</p></div>
