    <div class="footnote">Opportunistic reflects a ~2% premium to the 361 Central Ave comp on a $/buildable SF, $/door, and land $/SF basis, consistent with corridor appreciation since that August 2026 close. Base sits at approximately comp parity (~99%) and Conservative applies a modest discount (~98%) to reflect execution and entitlement risk.</div>
