    <div class="body" style="margin-top:16px;">
      <p>This transaction closed in <strong>August 2026</strong> and shows a strong comparison to where the value of your site would be. 361 Central is in the same zone, Neighborhood Commercial. The site is inline, like yours, meaning once built there will be properties on both sides (non-corner).</p>
      <p>What is most interesting about this site is that the seller listed it for <strong>$2.25M</strong> and a local developer came in, put it under contract, and flipped it to a real builder &mdash; not a speculator. The buyer purchased this land with the intent to build high-end condos.</p>
